  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "the audio filter seems to me a great idea, it is a step forward, but it would be nice if it was optional; in a normal way it is activated by default, and if the client wants,it can be deactivated, for example, in a dance club , so the client could choose if he wants it or not.\n\nAs I say, this feature seems very good, but in my opinion it is the final user who should decide whether to use it or not.",
